'''Satanmaria''' is an [[:Category:Uber Rare Cats|Uber Rare Cat]] that was added in [[Version 8.5 Update|Version 8.5]] and can be unlocked by playing the [[Cat Capsule#Rare Capsule|Rare Capsule]] during the [[Bikkuriman Collaboration Event]].

{{Cat Info
|ID = 470
|rarity = UR
|name1 = Satanmaria
|name2 = Wondermaria
}}

==Evolution==
Evolves into '''Wondermaria''' at level 10.

==Strategy/Usage==
Wondermaria is an aggressive midrange rusher that blitzes down melee enemies. She has above-average DPS, meaning she can effectively take care of anything that doesn't immediately outrange her. Her two biggest flaws, however, are her poor health (lower than even the likes of pre-[[True Form]] [[Raiden (Uber Rare Cat)|Raiden]]) and lack of backswing to prevent clipping into enemies. To compensate, she has low cooldown and frequent attacks. [[Berserkory]] and [[Johnnyleon]] are her best targets; both are Red, only have one knockback, and can't normally hit her, the reason being that their waves are nullified and that their [[Long Distance]] attacks miss respectively. Wondermaria's Red target and [[Immune to Waves|Wave Immune]] are still useful against other enemies such as [[J.K. Bun Bun]], [[Capy]], [[Dober P.D]], and [[Mr. Mer]]. She can deliver well as long as you have her risky nature in mind.

{{Job|Classification = Rusher & Midranger}}

